{"suttaId":"tha-ap424","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[53,114],"vripara":"15"},"segments":{"tha-ap424:0.3":"Ekadussadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap424:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, ahosiṃ tiṇahārako;","tha-ap424:1.3":"Tiṇahārena jīvāmi, tena posemi dārake.","tha-ap424:2.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap424:2.3":"Tamandhakāraṃ nāsetvā, uppajji lokanāyako.","tha-ap424:3.1":"“Sake ghare nisīditvā, evaṃ cintesi tāvade;","tha-ap424:3.3":"‘Buddho loke samuppanno, deyyadhammo na vijjati.","tha-ap424:4.1":"“‘Idaṃ me sāṭakaṃ ekaṃ, natthi me koci dāyako;","tha-ap424:4.3":"Dukkho nirayasamphasso, ropayissāmi dakkhiṇaṃ’.","tha-ap424:5.1":"“Evāhaṃ cintayitvāna, sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādayiṃ;","tha-ap424:5.3":"Ekaṃ dussaṃ gahetvāna, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap424:6.1":"“Ekaṃ dussaṃ daditvāna, ukkuṭṭhiṃ sampavattayiṃ;","tha-ap424:6.3":"‘Yadi buddho tuvaṃ vīra, tārehi maṃ mahāmuni’.","tha-ap424:7.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap424:7.3":"Mama dānaṃ pakittento, akā me anumodanaṃ.","tha-ap424:8.1":"“‘Iminā ekadussena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap424:8.3":"Kappasatasahassāni, vinipātaṃ na gacchasi.","tha-ap424:9.1":"“‘Chattiṃsakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjaṃ karissasi;","tha-ap424:9.3":"Tettiṃsakkhattuṃ rājā ca, cakkavattī [cakkavatti (syā.)] bhavissasi.","tha-ap424:10.1":"“‘Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ [asaṅkayaṃ (syā. ka.) evamuparipi];","tha-ap424:10.3":"Devaloke manusse vā, saṃsaranto tuvaṃ bhave.","tha-ap424:11.1":"“‘Rūpavā guṇasampanno, anavakkantadehavā [anuvattanta …(syā)];","tha-ap424:11.3":"Akkhobhaṃ amitaṃ dussaṃ, labhissasi yadicchakaṃ’.","tha-ap424:12.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sambuddho, jalajuttamanāmako;","tha-ap424:12.3":"Nabhaṃ abbhuggamī vīro [dhīro (sī. syā.)], haṃsarājāva ambare.","tha-ap424:13.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap424:13.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, ekadussassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap424:14.1":"“Paduddhāre paduddhāre, dussaṃ nibbattate mamaṃ;","tha-ap424:14.3":"Heṭṭhā dussamhi tiṭṭhāmi, uparicchadanaṃ mama.","tha-ap424:15.1":"“Cakkavāḷaṃ upādāya, sakānanaṃ sapabbataṃ;","tha-ap424:15.3":"Icchamāno cahaṃ ajja, dussehacchādayeyya taṃ.","tha-ap424:16.1":"“Teneva ekadussena, saṃsaranto bhavābhave;","tha-ap424:16.3":"Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo hutvāna, saṃsarāmi bhavābhave.","tha-ap424:17.1":"“Vipākaṃ viekadussassa, nājjhagaṃ katthacikkhayaṃ;","tha-ap424:17.3":"Ayaṃ me antimā jāti, vipaccati idhāpi me.","tha-ap424:18.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dussamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap424:18.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ekadussassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap424:19.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap424:20.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap424:21.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap424:22.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekadussadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap424:23.1":"Ekadussadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
